# The dashboard's env file — for PLAIN docker runs
# (`docker run --env-file env/dashboard.env pv-dashboard`). The compose
# stack does not read it: the compose's environment block carries the
# stack's PROM_URL and the page token — edit the compose or a
# docker-compose.override.yaml to change the stack's targets.

# The upstream Prometheus URL.
#PROM_URL=http://prometheus:9090

# The page's bearer token (F21): the default bind is 127.0.0.1 (tokenless,
# loopback-only). Publish beyond the loopback and the token becomes
# mandatory — a token-less non-loopback bind refuses to start (the F13
# shape). The value may be file:<path> (the first line of an owner-only
# 0600 file).
#AUTH_TOKEN=
#LISTEN=0.0.0.0:8080
